WEBVTT

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:11.160
Report! The west gate has opened,

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:14.620
and a thousand cavalry
have stormed the castle!

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:17.120
Excellent.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.040
"Chin"

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:21.000
"Sho"

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:27.960
Sa... Sai has... fallen...

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:30.380
It's done for...

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:43.480
Dammit... no way...

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:46.020
Damn it all!

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:49.490
What now, Shin?

00:00:49.490 --> 00:00:51.780
If we're seeing it through, we're with you.

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:56.660
Shin?

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:04.790
Shin...

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:14.550
Cheer up, Kou.

00:01:21.770 --> 00:01:23.480
We just got our miracle.

00:01:30.530 --> 00:01:32.360
We stuck it out

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:33.740
and we're gonna win!

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:10.670
Unprecedented Aid

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:21.550
The Fifth Evening

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:20.760
The mountain folk--reinforcements?!

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:21.760
Yes.

00:03:23.810 --> 00:03:28.190
I sent envoys to the stronghold of
the mountain king, Yo Tan Wa,

00:03:28.190 --> 00:03:30.690
before I left Kanyou.

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:31.690
However...

00:03:33.530 --> 00:03:37.950
The mountain folk's army
was not at their base,

00:03:37.950 --> 00:03:42.240
having gone on an expedition deep
into the northern mountains.

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:46.410
No... it can't be...

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:49.540
Our... our only hope...

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:53.630
My, that is a hardship indeed.

00:03:53.630 --> 00:03:57.510
But Yo Tan Wa is engaged
in a fateful battle herself,

00:03:57.510 --> 00:04:01.340
against the mighty Kabanko of the north.

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:03.930
Give it up. It's just bad timing.

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:09.310
<i>Those </i>geezers...

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:13.980
The elders did say they'd send
a messenger just in case,

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:16.570
but that was questionable, too.

00:04:16.570 --> 00:04:17.570
Besides...

00:04:21.410 --> 00:04:24.450
Even if we did get word to them,

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:28.120
if they were mid-battle, fighting for
control of the mountains,

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:29.830
there'd be no reinforcements.

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:32.580
If they dropped everything to come here,

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:35.380
all the gains, all the sacrifices
they'd seen so far

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:38.550
would be reduced to nothing.

00:04:38.550 --> 00:04:40.050
I get it.

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:44.390
Hence Shou Bun Kun's
baseless "eight days."

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:48.640
That's right.

