00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:56.100
{=12}mountain City

00:04:56.980 --> 00:04:57.980
But...

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:07.410
Sei.

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:10.160
What do you think?

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:14.040
You think they're comin'? Or not?

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:20.800
I--

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:43.150
And in seven days!

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:50.290
I was with you on this one--

00:05:50.290 --> 00:05:52.120
I thought they'd come, too.

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:59.710
Were we too late?

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:04.800
No--there are just barely some
Chin troops left on the castle walls.

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:07.800
Damn straight.
I'm not about to let this be <i>over</i>.

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:11.350
We tossed everything
aside to come out here!

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:13.640
But sheesh... even so...

00:06:18.150 --> 00:06:22.150
Our king sure is on a tear.

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:23.400
What was that?

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:31.580
It can't be!

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:33.620
Enemy attack!

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:36.540
Enemy spotted in the western mountains!

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:39.290
Alert all armies at once!

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:40.840
In the mountains?

00:06:40.840 --> 00:06:42.090
What <i>is </i>that?!

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:47.510
West Wall

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:46.340
It's all over...

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:47.800
Dammit...

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:50.720
All of that... for nothing...

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:52.560
Drop your weapons--now!

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:57.730
The Genma tribe
on the left is in position.

00:06:57.730 --> 00:07:00.480
As is the Shinba tribe on the right.

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:01.480
No!

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:03.820
There's no time!

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:05.700
All troops:

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:09.780
<i>Slaughter </i>them!

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:25.510
Wh-What's that?

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:42.480
Move!

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:44.030
What's going on?!

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:45.440
Those are...

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:47.490
...our reinforcements!

00:07:47.490 --> 00:07:50.910
Reinforcements on horseback
are scattering the Sho army!

00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:51.950
Huh?

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:55.450
Just <i>look </i>at them all!
So many reinforcements!

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:57.960
Reinforcements?!

00:07:57.960 --> 00:08:01.420
Kai Yoku, sir!
We have reinforcements from the west!

00:08:01.420 --> 00:08:03.630
My goodness...

00:08:03.630 --> 00:08:06.720
From the west? You can't mean--

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:09.470
You came...

00:08:09.470 --> 00:08:12.010
You mountain folk--

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:14.100
You really came!

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:21.650
Th-The mountain folk!

00:08:21.650 --> 00:08:24.070
Reinforcements, from that mountain?

00:08:24.070 --> 00:08:25.780
I was wrong not to tell you.

00:08:25.780 --> 00:08:27.570
Sei!

00:08:27.570 --> 00:08:28.990
For one thing,

00:08:28.990 --> 00:08:34.620
I felt it was risky to rely on
reinforcements that may or may not arrive.

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:38.830
You could have told <i>us</i>, at least.

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:40.710
Who else knew?

00:08:40.710 --> 00:08:42.790
Only Shou Bun Kun.

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:45.960
To prevent an information leak?

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:47.340
Exactly right.

00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:52.680
The west army is in great disarray!

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:54.850
South army! Regroup on the double!

00:08:54.850 --> 00:08:57.890
Get the troops who are
inside back out here!

00:08:57.890 --> 00:09:00.020
If word got out about
these reinforcements--

00:09:00.020 --> 00:09:02.190
if the news reached Ri Boku--

00:09:02.190 --> 00:09:04.650
he'd formulate a counterplan.

00:09:04.650 --> 00:09:09.990
We took scrupulous care to avoid
just that outcome, no matter what.

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:14.870
I have been caught utterly unprepared--me!

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:21.200
{=15}Chin

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:21.200
{=14}Mountain 
Realms

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:21.670
I <i>knew </i>a world of tribal lands
lay beyond Chin's western front...

00:09:21.670 --> 00:09:25.460
But to think they'd come
lend their support!

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:27.460
In hindsight,

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:32.470
covering up Sei Kyou's
uprising four years ago

00:09:32.470 --> 00:09:35.300
seems to have paid off.

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:37.720
The thorough regulation of information

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:41.810
kept the whole story from
leaving the Royal Court.

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:47.320
It's no wonder Ri Boku didn't know
we had the mountain folk's support.

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:52.950
This--This was preordained.

00:09:54.410 --> 00:09:58.870
One unforeseen event after another,
ever since we arrived...

00:09:58.870 --> 00:10:02.660
This was most likely being
concealed deliberately--

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:04.920
and I didn't notice.

00:10:05.920 --> 00:10:08.420
And it all starts

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:10.960
with the Chin King's appearance--
and what he could do.

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:14.800
This... <i>situation</i>...

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:16.680
...was preordained.

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:26.190
Wh-Why would the
mountain folk come help us?

00:10:26.190 --> 00:10:28.480
And in such huge numbers...

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:31.320
Damn monkeys!

00:10:31.320 --> 00:10:34.070
Why do this for us?

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:36.320
At any rate...

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:39.490
All we can do now is leave
everything in their hands:

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:42.160
Sai's fate--

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:44.120
And Chin's!

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:47.750
Win this for us!

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:49.170
We're counting on you!

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:52.710
Go!

00:10:54.470 --> 00:10:55.970
Go!

00:10:57.550 --> 00:10:59.140
Go!

00:11:13.070 --> 00:11:15.070
Wow!

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:16.200
Ba Jio...

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:18.870
Why, you...

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:22.490
Filthy monkeys!

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:25.080
Hey! It's him!

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:26.620
Fu Tei!

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:30.630
He's charging right into
the mountain folk's flank!

00:11:30.630 --> 00:11:33.800
That'll teach you to quit
your damn meddling,

00:11:33.800 --> 00:11:35.130
you rotten apes!

00:11:39.390 --> 00:11:42.600
Now that right there stinks
of high command.

00:11:42.600 --> 00:11:44.980
All right--we go right in!

00:11:44.980 --> 00:11:47.770
Kill the high-rankers and stop
the monkeys in their tracks!

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:53.530
No--wait!

00:11:53.530 --> 00:11:55.320
How are they moving so <i>fast</i>?!

00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:03.080
A... a <i>woman</i>?

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:05.040
And a real looker, too!

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:08.210
Huh?

00:12:08.210 --> 00:12:09.210
Whoa!

00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:12.420
What the--

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:14.380
What <i>is </i>that?

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:16.130
<i>That </i>is Ran Kai.

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:18.010
The west army is badly damaged!

00:12:18.010 --> 00:12:20.970
General Son Sei has been slain!

00:12:20.970 --> 00:12:23.640
The enemy troops number about 30,000!

00:12:23.640 --> 00:12:25.430
Some have entered the castle,

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:28.390
but their main forces are here--
and heading for our HQ!

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:32.520
The Fu Tei Force has struck at
their flank, but it's no easy fight!

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:36.480
The south army's defense is holding out,
but they can't stop the enemy...

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:39.610
Move away from our HQ at once, Ri Boku, sir!

00:12:41.450 --> 00:12:42.530
Ri Boku!

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:43.530
Ri Boku, sir!

00:12:48.290 --> 00:12:50.420
--Ri Boku, sir!
--Ri Boku!
--Ri Boku!
--Sir!

00:12:52.630 --> 00:12:54.090
We should withdraw.

00:12:55.550 --> 00:12:58.300
If the enemy roughly equals us in number,

00:12:58.300 --> 00:13:03.090
even intercepting them would
lose us more than half our troops.

00:13:03.090 --> 00:13:04.930
If that happens,

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:07.640
we would lack the might
to conquer Kanyou.

00:13:09.730 --> 00:13:14.270
This war is meaningless
if we can't take Kanyou.

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:16.190
We should retreat--immediately.

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:18.740
And yet...

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:23.240
If this army withdraws,

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:28.990
"Sho" "So" "Kan" "Gi" "En"

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:27.290
it means the coalition
army ends in failure!

00:13:33.210 --> 00:13:35.040
Ri Boku, my lord!

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:36.840
We'll serve as your shield.

00:13:36.840 --> 00:13:39.340
In the meantime, rally the troops!

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:42.340
May fortune be yours!

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:43.340
Kaine!

00:13:48.520 --> 00:13:49.680
Sou Ha!

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:51.520
An urgent message to all troops:

00:13:53.190 --> 00:13:55.360
All armies are to immediately--

00:14:04.200 --> 00:14:05.200
Hou Ken!

00:14:27.640 --> 00:14:29.140
Eyesores, all.

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:33.560
That's...

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:36.610
...the man who slayed
Ou Ki and Lord Hyou.

00:14:36.610 --> 00:14:38.480
One of Sho's Three Greats:

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:39.770
Hou Ken.

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:44.400
He seems to be headed this way.

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:45.780
I forbid it.

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:52.330
Yo Tan Wa and Hou Ken
are getting closer to each other!

00:14:57.380 --> 00:15:00.750
Yo Tan Wa, you can't! Get away from him!

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:02.800
That's no ordinary man!

00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:05.340
Leave--now! Let your troops handle him!

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:06.340
Let's go!

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:15.350
Hold up, Yo Tan Wa!

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:23.860
Mind if I take over from here?

00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:27.030
I'm the one who's gotta take him on.

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:39.250
No...

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:41.170
Shin...

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:43.760
But... but why?

00:15:43.760 --> 00:15:44.880
You're...

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:48.840
Hou Ken.

00:15:52.810 --> 00:15:55.430
Wait-- You're going <i>down </i>there?!

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:57.270
Now hang on, Shin!

00:15:57.270 --> 00:15:59.150
Why would you--

00:15:59.150 --> 00:16:01.230
I'm gonna slay Hou Ken.

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:03.230
What are you <i>talking </i>about?!

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:04.650
In your condition?

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:08.070
Hell, this is Hou Ken you're up against!

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:09.070
Move.

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:11.740
Knock it off already!

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:14.790
Did you forget our failure at Bayou?

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:20.330
A lot of us <i>died </i>defending you after
Hou Ken knocked you senseless!

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:21.670
Den Ei!

00:16:21.670 --> 00:16:24.300
That's how we lost Bi Tou!

00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:25.710
Hey! Den Ei!

00:16:27.720 --> 00:16:29.720
Tou has nothing to do with this.

00:16:32.640 --> 00:16:34.260
But...

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:37.810
Please, Shin... don't go.

00:16:37.810 --> 00:16:41.610
Ri Boku's army is probably on its way out.

00:16:41.610 --> 00:16:44.980
We can just leave the rest
to the troops below.

00:16:44.980 --> 00:16:47.990
If you die here today...

00:16:47.990 --> 00:16:50.740
Even if we win this battle, we'd--

00:16:50.740 --> 00:16:52.160
Step aside, Bi Hei.

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:54.530
But why?

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:57.290
<i>Why </i>do you have to go down there?

00:16:57.290 --> 00:17:00.670
Why do you always have
to <i>be </i>like this, Shin?!

00:17:04.090 --> 00:17:05.750
Why else?

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:12.510
I'm gonna be one of
the world's greatest generals.

00:17:58.310 --> 00:18:01.430
Shin... the absolute nerve...

00:18:05.400 --> 00:18:08.320
Mere rabble as you are...

00:18:08.320 --> 00:18:12.820
For this lot to bestir the
heavens is inexcusable.

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:16.030
There is but <i>one </i>who causeth
even the heavens fear!

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:19.410
I shall scatter the insects
that swarmeth here

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:23.080
and show thee once more who that is!

00:18:24.670 --> 00:18:26.170
Th-The horses!

00:18:27.130 --> 00:18:28.130
Shun!

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:32.720
I get it, Shun. You're scared, too.

00:18:32.720 --> 00:18:33.760
But...

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:39.390
It's still the same old us,
headin' in there.

00:18:46.610 --> 00:18:48.230
It's all right.

00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:50.860
You've got me with you--

00:18:50.860 --> 00:18:54.070
and a great general's shield.

00:18:54.070 --> 00:18:57.240
So don't be afraid.

00:18:57.240 --> 00:18:59.330
We'll ride,

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:01.040
just like always:

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:02.040
onward.

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:09.540
Go!

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:22.470
Shun!

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:35.570
Whoa! He took down that massive horse!

00:19:35.570 --> 00:19:38.740
Why would Shin's horse do such a thing?

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:43.370
P-Probably to get Hou Ken
down off <i>his </i>horse.

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:47.790
The difference in reach between
a poleaxe and a sword

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:51.420
would put Shin at a great
disadvantage on horseback.

00:19:51.420 --> 00:19:52.670
And that's why his horse...

00:19:54.260 --> 00:19:56.050
I'm sorry, Shun.

00:19:56.970 --> 00:19:57.970
Go!

00:19:57.970 --> 00:19:58.970
Shin!

00:20:04.600 --> 00:20:06.140
Shit--

00:20:06.140 --> 00:20:07.350
My ribs!

00:20:14.650 --> 00:20:16.150
Sh...

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:18.780
<i>Shin</i>!

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:21.410
--Shin!
--Hang in there!
--Captain!

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:27.000
On horseback or off, it's all
the same to Hou Ken!

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:30.080
Three cheers for Hou Ken
of the Three Greats!

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:35.340
The damned fool... I told him not to go.

00:20:35.340 --> 00:20:38.050
It's the same thing all over again!

00:20:38.050 --> 00:20:43.510
That was the <i>one man </i>you should've
steered clear of, you dumbass!

00:20:46.100 --> 00:20:47.100
Huh?

00:20:49.190 --> 00:20:52.150
Hold up... Hou Ken.

00:20:56.070 --> 00:20:59.860
I think... I might just...

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:01.660
...get it now...

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:05.620
Why a god of war--or whatever you are--

00:21:05.620 --> 00:21:09.330
struggled against General Hyou.

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:12.710
Why you couldn't best General Ou Ki.

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:18.050
The world's greatest generals...

00:21:18.050 --> 00:21:20.760
Once... just once...

00:21:20.760 --> 00:21:24.970
I took a blow from an
honest-to-goodness great general.

00:21:26.510 --> 00:21:31.060
That one blow had so much weight,
it felt like every bone in my body

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:33.690
was about to shatter.

00:21:34.440 --> 00:21:36.150
And Mister War God?

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:41.740
Your blade is light as <i>hell </i>in comparison!

00:21:41.740 --> 00:21:43.450
Like a damn <i>pebble</i>!

00:21:45.490 --> 00:21:48.290
That thing won't work on <i>me</i>.

00:21:54.460 --> 00:21:55.540
He stood up!

00:21:55.540 --> 00:21:56.590
Shin!

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:04.550
You lot know naught of my path.

00:22:04.550 --> 00:22:06.140
Damn thine impudence!

00:22:11.560 --> 00:22:14.350
I remember now, boy.

00:22:14.350 --> 00:22:17.730
Thou wert there, on Ou Ki's battlefield.

00:22:20.400 --> 00:22:23.450
Be it mere fluke or no,

00:22:23.450 --> 00:22:29.370
'tis a rare man indeed who battles
Hou Ken three times.

00:22:30.700 --> 00:22:33.960
There will not be a fourth.

00:22:37.000 --> 00:22:40.630
I shall cleave thee in twain,
body and soul,

00:22:40.630 --> 00:22:43.010
and send thee to Ou Ki!

00:22:44.630 --> 00:22:47.010
Talkin' a big game is fine and all,

00:22:47.010 --> 00:22:51.520
but after that blow earlier,
when I was already fallin' apart...

00:22:51.520 --> 00:22:55.600
I seriously have almost
no strength left in me.

00:22:55.600 --> 00:23:01.190
Another one like that and there's no way
I'm gonna be able to get back up.

00:23:01.190 --> 00:23:07.030
That said, I got no chance of dodgin'
anything at that speed, either.

00:23:07.030 --> 00:23:10.740
Which means...
there's only one thing to do!

00:23:13.620 --> 00:23:14.710
He stepped <i>forward</i>!

00:24:52.510 --> 00:25:02.020
Deepest Gratitude

00:24:54.180 --> 00:24:57.600
Next on <i>Kingdom</i>: "Deepest Gratitude."
